+ΓÇó Web Bluetooth: Built into Chrome/Edge, but currently only allows connecting to BLE peripherals
+ (e.g. IoT devices), not to other phones running the gameπÇÉ13ΓÇáL25-L28πÇæ. In practice, true P2P
+ between browsers is not supported, so on-the-fly multiplayer must use native Bluetooth or a
+ mesh network.
